\nAlso, note: The task says \"Apply deterministic chunk-removal and granularity-refinement passes while preserving a supplied syntax and interestingness oracle.\" The syntax and interestingness oracle are not explicitly provided; they are implied by the required_failure_items condition. So our interestingness function is simply checking that all required items remain.\n\nImplementation exactly as described.\n\nLet's produce final JSON."},"logprobs":null,"finish_reason":"stop"}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":811,"completion_tokens":4216,"total_tokens":5027,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":768},"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":3869},"prompt_cache_hit_tokens":768,"prompt_cache_miss_tokens":43},"system_fingerprint":"fp_8b330d02d0_prod0820_fp8_kvcache_20260402"}